# Options → "LED ticker brightness". Captures the Stock Exchange boards at each level (point the
# camera at the Stock Exchange, ideally in daylight). The player's choice is put back at the end.
name LED ticker brightness: Classic, Bright and Brightest repaint the boards at once
ticker-brightness classic
expect-log ticker brightness Classic gain=#4EF465
capture ticker-classic
ticker-brightness bright
expect-log ticker brightness Bright
capture ticker-bright
ticker-brightness brightest
expect-log ticker brightness Brightest
capture ticker-brightest
cleanup:
ticker-brightness restore
